{
  "uid": "polaris-dependencies",
  "title": "Dependencies",
  "description": "Client-side view of Postgres, Kafka, Redis and Keycloak as seen by the apps. No server-side exporters exist yet (see the note panel).",
  "tags": [
    "polaris",
    "dependencies",
    "postgres",
    "kafka",
    "redis",
    "keycloak"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(jvm_memory_used_bytes, exported_job)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "qryType": 1
        },
        "definition": "label_values(jvm_memory_used_bytes, exported_job)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment (logs)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": {
          "refId": "LokiVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "type": 1,
          "label": "deployment_environment"
        },
        "definition": "deployment_environment",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "What is and is not measured",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Available (client side):** Postgres via HikariCP and Spring Data repository timings; Kafka via the Kafka client (consumer lag, producer send/error rates) and Spring Kafka listener timings; Redis via Lettuce command timings; Keycloak via Tempo span metrics and the service graph (it emits traces only).\n\n**Not available:** Postgres, Kafka broker, Redis and Keycloak server-side metrics (no `postgres_exporter`, Kafka/JMX exporter, `redis_exporter`; Keycloak metrics endpoint is not scraped). Kafka consumer-group lag and outbox age are plan slice O6; their panels do not exist yet. `env` filters Loki panels only: span and app metrics carry no `deployment.environment` label today (Tempo only exposes it on `traces_target_info`, and only for services that set it)."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Postgres (HikariCP and repositories)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Connection pool",
      "description": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job, pool)(hikaricp_connections_active{exported_job=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}} active",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job, pool)(hikaricp_connections_idle{exported_job=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}} idle",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job, pool)(hikaricp_connections_pending{exported_job=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}} pending",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (exported_job, pool)(hikaricp_connections_max{exported_job=~\"$service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{exported_job}} max",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
